cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or build on this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TD-H9 APRS Smart Beaconing"
abstract: >-
  Reverse engineering of the TIDRADIO TD-H9 handheld radio (JieLi AC695X SoC
  and ARM APRS module) to add GNSS-driven APRS smart beaconing, with a
  portable C99 beacon scheduler and NMEA RMC parser.
authors:
  - family-names: Kuehn
    given-names: Tomasz
version: 1.0.0
license:
  - MIT
  - CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - APRS
  - AX.25
  - ham radio
  - smart beaconing
  - reverse engineering
  - firmware
  - GNSS
